This is a place to play with the command line.

Before you start, make sure any work you have on other projects is committed and
synced to Github so if you completely destroy this codespace you don't lose
anything important.

Then, right click setup.sh and "Open in Integrated terminal". Then type:

./setup.sh

Then to see more things to try run:

cat commands-to-try.txt

Also look at the two zines I gave you for ideas. For your own sanity, try to
stay within this project directory.
